Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.97,0:03:13.98,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,SEMUA ITU TIDAK PENTING!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.31,0:00:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mendarat dengan selamat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.65,0:00:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Turunkan semua orang! Cepat!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita selamat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.02,0:00:10.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita akan aman sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.28,0:00:14.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua orang sudah turun?\NKami akan kembali ke medan perang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.33,0:00:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayah Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.50,0:00:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami ikut denganmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:21.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian terluka. Ikut evakuasi\Ndengan yang lain, jadi anak baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.94,0:00:23.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ta-Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:25.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan khawatir, kalian berdua.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:28.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian sudah tunjukkan keberanian\Nyang lebih dari cukup.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.70,0:00:30.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Senior...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.34,0:00:33.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon akan baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo kita percaya padanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.66,0:00:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.54,0:00:39.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Percaya padanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.35,0:00:43.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak mungkin, tidak mungkin, tidak mungkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.26,0:00:44.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mustahil!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.71,0:00:56.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Se-Semuanya akan berakhir bagi kita!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.07,0:01:11.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau gabung dengan mesin aneh,\Ntapi itu tidak ada bedanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.16,0:01:21.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kubunuh kalian semua,\Npara penjahat, di Kerajaan Holfort!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.67,0:01:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia sudah hilang akal sehatnya.\NZirah ajaib sudah ambil alih tubuhnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.68,0:01:27.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.87,0:01:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau begitu ingin bertarung,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pak Tua?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.61,0:01:45.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Trapped in a Dating Sim
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.32,0:01:49.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}The World of Otome Games is Tough for Mobs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.24,0:02:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Trapped in a Dating Sim 2: The World\Nof Otome Games is Tough for Mobs
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.61,0:03:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada satu cara untuk hentikan monster itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.15,0:03:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benarkah begitu, Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.42,0:03:16.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudku, Nona Marie?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:23.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cuma pernah menonton film\Nyang kakakku buka di dalam gim, tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.35,0:03:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Monster itu dipanggil pakai benda\Nbernama seruling ajaib.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.14,0:03:33.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betul. Di karyawisata, aku lihat\Nmonster dipanggil dengan mataku sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:35.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seruling ajaib...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.06,0:03:39.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sumber suara seruling adalah kapal itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.08,0:03:45.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo pergi ke sana.\NKita harus akhiri penderitaan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.42,0:03:48.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah! Menuju orang\Nyang memegang seruling ajaib!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.63,0:03:51.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah? Kau pikir kau siapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.13,0:03:52.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tidak bisa perintah aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.86,0:03:55.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau juga tidak tahu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.58,0:03:57.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kyle! Lakukan saja apa katanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.70,0:04:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya ampun... Kau tidak pernah berubah, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.27,0:04:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?\NCuma itu yang bisa kau lakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.75,0:04:09.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam, dasar prajurit yang jatuh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Awas!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.61,0:04:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Argh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:25.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak akan terjadi! Tidak! Tidak!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.70,0:04:28.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya ampun, jeritan yang memalukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.38,0:04:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi tidak apa-apa sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.46,0:04:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Are...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.11,0:04:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, itu nama panggilan untukku?\NAku sudah merasa seperti teman!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimanapun, tidak perlu khawatir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.24,0:04:43.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Si murung itu akan memberikan perlindungan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.88,0:04:45.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengisi daya bank energi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.02,0:04:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menembakkan meriam boson.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.09,0:05:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ca-Cahaya apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.50,0:05:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku belum pernah lihat sihir seperti itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.74,0:05:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, itu sihir.\NMantra ajaib yang luar biasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ti-Tidak, itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.78,0:05:15.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Murka Raja Kegelapan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pergi sekarang! Sebelum monster itu pulih!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, aku tahu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.36,0:05:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagus, sekarang kita sediakan perlindungan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.50,0:05:32.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan perintah aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.51,0:05:40.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ketemu! Seruling ajaib!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.70,0:05:41.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.35,0:05:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hertrude!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.14,0:05:45.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sedang apa kau di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.82,0:05:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu, apa kau yang memainkannya?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.61,0:05:52.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua orang bisa mati saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.69,0:05:57.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong berhenti.\NKalau terus begini, semua orang akan mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.97,0:05:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lantas?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.69,0:06:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lantas? Orang-orang\Ndari Kerajaan Fanoss juga akan mati!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:06.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo kita akhiri ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.59,0:06:07.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.62,0:06:09.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak. Tidak akan pernah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.98,0:06:10.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.86,0:06:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kalian mau membunuhku, lakukan saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.77,0:06:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu tidak akan hentikan Dewa Penjaga Tanah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau bisa membunuhnya,\Ntapi ia akan hidup lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku paham kalian membenci kami,\Ntapi apa gunanya pertarungan sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.86,0:06:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang-orang akan terus mati sia-sia!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.59,0:06:30.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.06,0:06:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kau telusuri, Kerajaan Fanoss
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}merupakan bagian\Ndari garis keturunan Holfort!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:37.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah. Kerajaan Fanoss?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.58,0:06:40.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak peduli lagi\Ndengan Kerajaan Fanoss.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.94,0:06:42.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.13,0:06:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.02,0:06:45.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka memanfaatkanku...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:49.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka memanfaatkan adikku dan aku\Ndemi tujuan mereka sendiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.51,0:06:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak peduli\Napa yang terjadi pada mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.87,0:06:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami tidak tahu\Nmereka membunuh orang tua kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka mempermainkan kami\Nseperti orang bodoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.99,0:07:05.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka merenggut semua yang kupedulikan,\Ntermasuk adikku, Rauda.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.49,0:07:07.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak akan pernah\Npercaya siapa pun lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya... Mereka semua\Nbisa menghilang saja!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.27,0:07:14.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sangat ingin hancurkan\Ndunia yang tidak berharga ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.63,0:07:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin balaskan\Ndendam adikku dan orang tuaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.64,0:07:20.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah begitu?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.31,0:07:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beri tahu aku alasannya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.16,0:07:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kami tidak bisa punya kebahagiaan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.38,0:07:26.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beri tahu aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.17,0:07:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ba-Bagaimanapun, ini salah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:32.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang akan dicapai\Ndengan membalas dendam?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Melakukan itu\Ntidak akan buat adikmu bahagia!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.06,0:07:37.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.46,0:07:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam saja, dasar tak punya otak!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.28,0:07:40.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.97,0:07:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Marie?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Apa yang kau katakan?\NKau di pihak siapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.70,0:07:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak peduli! Semua itu tidak penting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:51.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang kalian lakukan cuma berbasa-basi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Membalas dendam itu salah?\NKau pikir aku peduli?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.91,0:07:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau pikir kau siapa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu tidak akan buat adikmu bahagia?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.74,0:08:02.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sejak kapan kau bisa putuskan\Nbagaimana perasaan orang lain?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sadarlah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ta-Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.84,0:08:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia harus hancur tanpa kesempatan\Nuntuk membalas dendam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di mana haknya atas kebahagiaan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:13.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana perasaannya soal itu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:16.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Silakan lontarkan pidato sombong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.96,0:08:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisakah kau diam saja kalau mereka bunuh\Norang yang kau sayangi?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.46,0:08:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tidak akan coba balas dendam,\Nmeski itu salah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.27,0:08:24.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.39,0:08:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pernahkah kau menyesali sesuatu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.94,0:08:30.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pernahkah kau kehilangan seseorang\Nyang kau sayangi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.24,0:08:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tidak akan pernah lihat dia lagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.05,0:08:36.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya sakit!\NKehilangan orang yang kita sayangi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.37,0:08:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu sungguh, sangat menyakitkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.74,0:08:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tu-Tunggu! Menghentikan monster itu\Nadalah prioritas pertama kita!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam, kau!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.08,0:08:47.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau cuma itu yang diperlukan\Nuntuk akhiri dunia ini,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.60,0:08:49.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}itu bisa sudah berakhir!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.50,0:08:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia tahu itu salah! Dia tahu itu buruk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.42,0:08:54.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:58.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi dia tetap tidak bisa menahan diri!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.66,0:09:46.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak pernah membayangkan\Nsaint kikir yang cuma peduli soal uang
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.65,0:09:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}akan membelaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.18,0:09:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hmph. Aku tidak membelamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.70,0:09:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cuma tidak suka mereka berdua.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.18,0:09:56.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wanita-wanita yang bertingkah\Nseolah merekalah protagonisnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.05,0:10:03.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak akan bisa\Nmerasa seperti ini tanpamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.94,0:10:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi apa kau\Nsungguh baik-baik saja dengan ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.38,0:10:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.02,0:10:11.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak suka ini sedikit pun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.23,0:10:14.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.43,0:10:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang, kalian semua, menjauhlah dariku.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.26,0:10:24.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.46,0:10:25.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.64,0:10:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harga untuk memanggil Dewa Penjaga\Ndengan seruling ajaib
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.75,0:10:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}adalah nyawa pemanggilnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.55,0:10:32.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah batalkan kontraknya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.45,0:10:36.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak bisa pakai seruling ajaib lagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.27,0:10:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dewa Penjaga akan membunuhku sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.14,0:10:40.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:42.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ta-Tapi itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, Kerajaan Fanoss... akan menyerah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.45,0:10:56.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya! Mundur!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.42,0:11:01.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Livia! Kau baik-baik saja?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.84,0:11:02.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Vandel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.46,0:11:04.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.99,0:11:07.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa yang lain ada di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.05,0:11:11.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu, Hertrude juga?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.05,0:11:19.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Vandel, cukup!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.23,0:11:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fanoss sudah nyatakan perang ini berakhir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.30,0:11:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Putri, te-tenanglah...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.80,0:11:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kubunuh penjahat itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.74,0:11:35.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kulenyapkan\Npasukan Kerajaan Holfort untukmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.81,0:11:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak! Semuanya sudah berakhir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.39,0:11:39.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Vandel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.18,0:11:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah... Tuan Putri...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.56,0:11:58.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Ayah... Ibu...\N- Apa ini sungguh jalan yang benar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.99,0:12:03.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rakyat dan bangsawan menginginkan perang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.85,0:12:08.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, Yang Mulia harus tinggalkan lokasi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.19,0:12:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada gunanya\Nmenyesali apa yang sudah berlalu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.69,0:12:15.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau bisa membalas dendam\Nuntuk keluargamu sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.39,0:12:19.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kesatria dari Kerajaan Fanoss\Ntak membawa penyesalan yang sia-sia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.35,0:12:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Putri...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.13,0:12:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Vandel...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.93,0:12:39.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tenanglah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.08,0:12:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku, Vandel, akan bertarung untukmu\Nmenggantikan ayah dan ibumu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:50.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Vandel...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.75,0:12:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bersumpah demi pedangku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.71,0:13:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini tidak bisa berakhir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.06,0:13:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak bisa biarkan ini berakhir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Vandel...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.63,0:13:10.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harus bertarung,\Nmeski itu hancurkan tubuh ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.23,0:13:13.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma itu yang bisa kulakukan\Nuntuk menebus dosa-dosaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.61,0:13:15.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini adalah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.14,0:13:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jalan kesatriaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.67,0:13:54.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.80,0:13:59.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luxion!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.64,0:14:03.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurang ajar kau!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.01,0:14:07.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf, Pak Tua.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.87,0:14:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.06,0:14:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Vandel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.43,0:14:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Vandel...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.83,0:14:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Vandel! Vandel!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.32,0:14:52.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tu-Tuan Putri...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.47,0:14:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini adalah akhir bagiku...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.05,0:15:00.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong jangan tinggalkan aku sendirian!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.52,0:15:03.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Putri...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.99,0:15:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, kau!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:07.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berhentilah bertingkah bodoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei! Apa yang kau katakan?!\NDia itu Kesatria Hitam!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.53,0:15:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tahu itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.29,0:15:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berapa kali menurutmu\Ndia hampir membunuhku?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.27,0:15:17.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi apa aku peduli?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, kau! Apa kau\Nakan tinggalkan dia sendirian?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.07,0:15:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, jadi ada orang-orang
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}di Kerajaan Holfort\Nyang akan menjaga Tuan Putri?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.15,0:15:37.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang, aku bisa pergi dengan tenang...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, aku kalah...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.95,0:15:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putri, tolong...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.62,0:15:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Vandel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.78,0:16:03.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Carilah kebahagiaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.16,0:16:08.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Vandel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.58,0:16:34.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang, cukup buang-buang waktunya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.23,0:16:37.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kalian tidak pergi sekarang,\Nkalian juga akan ditangkap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.18,0:16:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ta-Tapi...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.83,0:16:42.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo, kalian berdua.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.94,0:16:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepatlah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.02,0:16:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhiri ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.10,0:17:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon Fou Bartfort...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.71,0:17:14.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, kita lakukan apa sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.64,0:17:18.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ia cuma akan beregenerasi tiap kali\Nkita hadapi ia dengan pukulan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.97,0:17:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selain itu, Olivia dalam kondisi lemah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.95,0:17:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luxion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.79,0:17:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dimengerti.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.48,0:17:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu tidak akan mencapai tubuhnya,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.40,0:17:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi aku akan kumpulkan energi di Arroganz.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.86,0:17:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah? Apa yang tidak akan mencapainya?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.03,0:17:40.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kekuatan Olivia.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.14,0:17:43.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.67,0:17:46.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Livia... Ange...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.83,0:17:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan gabungkan\Ngelombang Olivia jadi serangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.29,0:17:59.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini kesempatan kita.\NAyo jadikan ini kesempatan bagus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.88,0:18:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan biarkan mereka mendekat!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.35,0:18:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan perintah aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.95,0:18:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Fabulous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.48,0:19:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pria itu... menyelamatkanku?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.79,0:19:12.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah tidak ada!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.18,0:19:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berhasil!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.19,0:19:18.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya, kita kalahkan bos akhir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.12,0:19:21.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun, sepertinya Arroganz\Nsudah mencapai batasnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.13,0:19:21.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.22,0:19:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:32.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya ampun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.82,0:19:51.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, apa aku sudah lakukan hal yang benar?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.24,0:19:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku bilang aku ingin\Nhidup tenang sebagai mob di belakang,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.61,0:20:01.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi pada akhirnya, banyak orang mati.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.53,0:20:04.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga membunuh banyak orang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.66,0:20:10.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Seorang protagonis pasti melakukan\Npekerjaan yang jauh lebih baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.91,0:20:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau terlalu sadar diri. Perang terjadi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.83,0:20:20.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada seorang pun\Nyang berharap begitu banyak darimu, Tuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.71,0:20:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Heh. Astaga, kau jahat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.08,0:20:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pada akhirnya, aku hanyalah mob.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.23,0:20:35.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi bagaimana kita bisa menang?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.93,0:20:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin karena ini dunia gim otome\Nseperti yang kau katakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.75,0:20:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah? Apa artinya itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.95,0:20:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau selalu mengumpat keras-keras\Nsaat kau mengatakannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.23,0:20:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cintalah yang akan selamatkan dunia ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:53.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.03,0:21:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.53,0:21:14.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ange... Livia...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.87,0:21:21.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan, kau mungkin mob,\Ntapi cinta mereka pasti sungguhan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.91,0:21:25.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang tak dapat disangkal\Nbahwa cinta mengakhiri perang.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:29.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin kau harus bersiap\Nuntuk yang terburuk, Tuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.74,0:21:33.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau menyukai mereka berdua, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.69,0:21:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau benar-benar tidak tahu apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.85,0:21:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku memang menyukai keduanya,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.70,0:21:42.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi aku ingin lakukan yang terbaik\Nuntuk keduanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:49.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku belum pikirkan apa yang harus\Nkukatakan, jadi untuk saat ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.98,0:21:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kembali.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.99,0:23:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perang berakhir, perdamaian kembali,\Ndan kakakku bertunangan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.57,0:23:30.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.28,0:23:32.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Teriakan Leon menggema\Ndi masa depan yang tak bisa dia hindari!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.86,0:23:33.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.77,0:23:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Episode terakhir, "Dunia Ini Sulit Bagi Mob".
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.59,0:23:39.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bos akhir dalam kehidupan\Nadalah peristiwa romantis!
